{"id":17724,"author":"Tazz","body":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003eI am going to be taking over the community removals seeing as Robin who was doing these stepped down.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eIn our recent Map development meeting have we been discussing a lot of things. And one the things we'd like to introduce is something we call \"The community removal\". We're doing this to get the community's feedback on maps, if they would like to keep the maps or not.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis thread will be rebooted every week with 4 new maps!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eLast week's results are following:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eDust Devils:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eRelocate the monument locations\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHoneybomb:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eRemove\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHalcyon:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Add some more iron\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeres:\u003c/b\u003e Remove\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eSo, how does this little thing work?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eEvery week on this thread you will see 4 maps. These maps are being discussed if we should keep or not. Under me you will right now see four different maps. We, Map Developers would like you to share your thought of this map. Do you want this map to stay, or get removed? When you give your opinion on the map, please do motivate why you think like you do. Maybe we wont have to remove the map and instead make a certain change to it instead! And remember to\u0026nbsp;\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003ealways\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u0026nbsp;put the tag \"keep, edit or remove\", otherwise we Map developers may not understand your point and we get confused if you want to keep it or not.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe following 4 maps that will either be removed/stay:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eUnix:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/Unix/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/Unix/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRendezvous Redux:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/rendezvousredux/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/rendezvousredux/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDragon Valley:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/DRAGONvalley/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/DRAGONvalley/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eInfernus:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/Infernus/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/Infernus/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis is when you can make a change, please motivate why you think like you do. Hopefully this will improve and create a better avicus experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Map Devs","body_tagged":"Hello,\u003cbr\u003eI am going to be taking over the community removals seeing as Robin who was doing these stepped down.\u0026nbsp;\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eIn our recent Map development meeting have we been discussing a lot of things. And one the things we'd like to introduce is something we call \"The community removal\". We're doing this to get the community's feedback on maps, if they would like to keep the maps or not.\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis thread will be rebooted every week with 4 new maps!\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eLast week's results are following:\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eDust Devils:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eRelocate the monument locations\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHoneybomb:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eRemove\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eHalcyon:\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;Add some more iron\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb\u003eTeres:\u003c/b\u003e Remove\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eSo, how does this little thing work?\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eEvery week on this thread you will see 4 maps. These maps are being discussed if we should keep or not. Under me you will right now see four different maps. We, Map Developers would like you to share your thought of this map. Do you want this map to stay, or get removed? When you give your opinion on the map, please do motivate why you think like you do. Maybe we wont have to remove the map and instead make a certain change to it instead! And remember to\u0026nbsp;\u003cu\u003e\u003cb\u003ealways\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u0026nbsp;put the tag \"keep, edit or remove\", otherwise we Map developers may not understand your point and we get confused if you want to keep it or not.\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThe following 4 maps that will either be removed/stay:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#333333\" face=\"Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eUnix:\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/Unix/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/Unix/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRendezvous Redux:\u003cbr\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/rendezvousredux/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/rendezvousredux/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDragon Valley:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/DRAGONvalley/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/DRAGONvalley/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eInfernus:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cimg src=\"https://avicus.net/maps/Infernus/image\" title=\"Image: https://avicus.net/maps/Infernus/image\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/div\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003e--------\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.4444446563721px; line-height: 23.9999980926514px;\"\u003eThis is when you can make a change, please motivate why you think like you do. Hopefully this will improve and create a better avicus experience.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003eRegards\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe Map Devs","created_at":1446334249,"title":"The community removal | #3","replies":[{"id":245627,"author":"Fouled","body":"Nice","body_tagged":"Nice","created_at":1446334615},{"id":245630,"author":"Spoookeh","body":"\u003cb\u003eUnix-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, good gameplay but maybe move the monuments back a little.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003erendezvous redux-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, a good map like the original with nice aesthetics.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDragon Valley-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eRemove, can be too confusing and gameplay is bad.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eInfernus-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, good gameplay and fun to play.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYoure welcome Tazz (:","body_tagged":"\u003cb\u003eUnix-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, good gameplay but maybe move the monuments back a little.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003erendezvous redux-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, a good map like the original with nice aesthetics.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eDragon Valley-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eRemove, can be too confusing and gameplay is bad.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb\u003eInfernus-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003eKeep, good gameplay and fun to play.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eYoure welcome Tazz (:","created_at":1446334742},{"id":245632,"author":"Tynvale","body":"I enjoy playing all of these maps :P","body_tagged":"I enjoy playing all of these maps :P","created_at":1446334848},{"id":245634,"author":"Glesmon","body":"These are all fun","body_tagged":"These are all fun","created_at":1446335193},{"id":245635,"author":"Itsameekizzii","body":"I'm not a fan of unix I don't like Unix mainly because of the space issue.","body_tagged":"I'm not a fan of unix I don't like Unix mainly because of the space issue.","created_at":1446335243},{"id":245648,"author":"jracer15","body":"Keep all but Infernus","body_tagged":"Keep all but Infernus","created_at":1446337489},{"id":245649,"author":"Numberz","body":"\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003eUnix:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003e[KEEP] Make changes to the monument placements, too far away IMO. Also make the enchantment table more visible? (Hiding them underground is pointless) possibly move them near the front if spawn?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRendezvous Redux:\u003c/b\u003e [KEEP] The gameplay is decent on this map I would recommend lowering the diamond supply and adding more iron.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDragon Valley-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e[REMOVE] The map has so many problems and is very confusing.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eInfernus-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e[KEEP] I'm not a huge fan of the map but its plays pretty well. No complaints.\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003eUnix:\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/b\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003e[KEEP] Make changes to the monument placements, too far away IMO. Also make the enchantment table more visible? (Hiding them underground is pointless) possibly move them near the front if spawn?\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eRendezvous Redux:\u003c/b\u003e [KEEP] The gameplay is decent on this map I would recommend lowering the diamond supply and adding more iron.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDragon Valley-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e[REMOVE] The map has so many problems and is very confusing.\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cbr style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003e\u003cb style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 24px;\"\u003eInfernus-\u0026nbsp;\u003c/b\u003e[KEEP] I'm not a huge fan of the map but its plays pretty well. No complaints.\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 14.4444446563721px;\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e","created_at":1446337567},{"id":245650,"author":"_Nathy","body":"Unix keep\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003erendezvous redux remove, It basically the same as regular rendezvous so I don't see the point of it\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edragon valley edit, spin spawn around to face mid and maybe get rid of some stuff in mid as it seems crowded\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003einfernus make the 2 islands wider and add a premade bridge from spawn instead of that rickety bridge","body_tagged":"Unix keep\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003erendezvous redux remove, It basically the same as regular rendezvous so I don't see the point of it\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003edragon valley edit, spin spawn around to face mid and maybe get rid of some stuff in mid as it seems crowded\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003einfernus make the 2 islands wider and add a premade bridge from spawn instead of that rickety bridge","created_at":1446337694},{"id":245657,"author":"Zegita","body":"